00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:30.965
Gonna knock this back.

00:12:32.166 --> 00:12:33.046
Guaranteed no hangover.

00:12:33.446 --> 00:12:34.806
What kind of person is that?

00:12:35.645 --> 00:12:36.765
That's one of my roommates.

00:12:36.885 --> 00:12:37.526
She does live streaming.

00:12:39.485 --> 00:12:40.125
Where's your room?

00:12:40.446 --> 00:12:41.005
Over here, Dad.

00:12:41.245 --> 00:12:41.645
You passed it.

00:12:41.645 --> 00:12:42.286
This... This way.

00:12:47.046 --> 00:12:48.565
Let me apologize.

00:12:48.566 --> 00:12:49.446
I was wrong.

00:12:49.526 --> 00:12:50.365
I really didn't mean to

00:12:50.365 --> 00:12:51.326
hide it from you.

00:12:52.125 --> 00:12:53.645
It's just that

00:12:53.686 --> 00:12:55.045
it happened so suddenly.

00:12:55.046 --> 00:12:57.086
I was afraid you'd worry
if you found out.

00:12:57.365 --> 00:12:57.845
So I thought

00:12:58.005 --> 00:12:59.685
I'd get settled here first,

00:12:59.686 --> 00:13:00.806
then tell you.

00:13:00.965 --> 00:13:01.965
Settled?

00:13:03.125 --> 00:13:04.526
This is Jingzhou.

00:13:05.566 --> 00:13:07.245
Talented people
from all over the country flock here.

00:13:07.365 --> 00:13:08.005
This is where

00:13:08.006 --> 00:13:09.485
the competition is fiercest.

00:13:09.645 --> 00:13:10.446
You're here all alone,

00:13:10.485 --> 00:13:11.365
away from home.

00:13:12.005 --> 00:13:14.686
No degree, no background,
no connections.

00:13:15.686 --> 00:13:17.046
It's not going to be easy.

00:13:17.365 --> 00:13:18.206
Your dad's right.

00:13:19.365 --> 00:13:20.046
Easy or not,

00:13:20.086 --> 00:13:21.526
just let me try, alright?

00:13:21.806 --> 00:13:22.925
No matter how hard it is,

00:13:22.926 --> 00:13:24.286
It's better than enduring disrespect
at Lin Tao's, right?

00:13:25.406 --> 00:13:26.166
True.

00:13:27.485 --> 00:13:28.765
Who would've known Lin Tao's family

00:13:28.806 --> 00:13:29.765
would be like that?

00:13:31.446 --> 00:13:32.245
But Lin,

00:13:32.605 --> 00:13:33.046
well...

00:13:33.686 --> 00:13:34.446
I really think

00:13:34.446 --> 00:13:35.286
you should come back home

00:13:35.287 --> 00:13:36.806
with us.

00:13:37.446 --> 00:13:38.446
It might be a small town,

00:13:38.566 --> 00:13:40.005
but you'd have a stable life

00:13:41.485 --> 00:13:43.245
with us around.

00:13:43.286 --> 00:13:43.965
Isn't that right?

00:13:44.446 --> 00:13:45.605
Put in some more effort,

00:13:45.885 --> 00:13:46.965
and pass the civil service exam.

00:13:47.125 --> 00:13:48.166
Make the Lin family envy you.

00:13:48.206 --> 00:13:48.806
How about that?

00:13:50.046 --> 00:13:51.645
Pass the civil service exam? Dad,

00:13:51.965 --> 00:13:52.885
you know

00:13:52.885 --> 00:13:53.806
I've never been cut out

00:13:53.806 --> 00:13:54.326
for studying.

00:13:54.446 --> 00:13:55.725
The civil service exam?

00:13:55.926 --> 00:13:56.485
I'm staying here.

00:13:56.485 --> 00:13:57.046
Now you admit

00:13:57.047 --> 00:13:58.566
you're not cut out for studying?

00:13:58.965 --> 00:14:00.765
And who was the one
who begged and pleaded

00:14:01.046 --> 00:14:01.686
to repeat a year

00:14:01.765 --> 00:14:02.765
to try for schools in Jingzhou?

00:14:03.166 --> 00:14:03.926
For your sake,

00:14:04.406 --> 00:14:06.046
we didn't even let Qiao Yan
take the exam.

00:14:06.605 --> 00:14:07.725
Now you're blaming me for that?

00:14:07.765 --> 00:14:08.046
Dad,

00:14:08.206 --> 00:14:09.485
you're the one who drove her away.

00:14:16.806 --> 00:14:17.885
Yan has a boyfriend.

00:14:17.965 --> 00:14:18.645
Did you know that?

00:14:18.806 --> 00:14:19.686
Don't even mention her.

00:14:21.166 --> 00:14:21.885
She's getting married

00:14:21.965 --> 00:14:23.005
and didn't even plan to invite us.

00:14:23.206 --> 00:14:23.725
Getting married?

00:14:26.086 --> 00:14:26.806
Why didn't she tell me?

00:14:27.406 --> 00:14:27.965
Dad, Mom,

00:14:28.845 --> 00:14:30.405
do you want to

00:14:30.406 --> 00:14:31.166
attend her wedding?

00:14:33.125 --> 00:14:34.046
Any parent

00:14:34.765 --> 00:14:35.686
would want to see

00:14:35.725 --> 00:14:36.765
their own daughter get married.

00:14:36.845 --> 00:14:37.725
I don't.

00:14:38.605 --> 00:14:40.326
She's materialistic, looks down on us.

00:14:40.446 --> 00:14:41.885
I don't have a daughter like that.

00:14:42.206 --> 00:14:42.885
Dad.

00:14:43.365 --> 00:14:44.885
Yes, I'm talking about you! So what?

00:14:45.566 --> 00:14:46.206
You're just deliberately

00:14:46.286 --> 00:14:46.885
not answering your phone!

00:14:47.005 --> 00:14:48.245
You're just trying to
scam that compensation.

00:14:48.806 --> 00:14:49.166
Go on then!

00:14:49.326 --> 00:14:50.046
File a complaint against me. Go on!

00:14:51.166 --> 00:14:51.926
That's the other roommate.

00:14:52.365 --> 00:14:52.845
All here.

00:14:58.005 --> 00:14:58.526
Yan.

00:14:58.765 --> 00:14:59.686
I'm the bigger person here.

00:14:59.687 --> 00:15:00.845
I can let it slide.

00:15:01.526 --> 00:15:03.605
But you didn't let Mom and Dad
attend your wedding.

00:15:04.406 --> 00:15:05.485
You must have said that out of anger.

00:15:05.566 --> 00:15:05.926
Right?

00:15:06.845 --> 00:15:07.526
Mom and Dad

00:15:07.566 --> 00:15:08.526
haven't gone back home yet.

00:15:08.845 --> 00:15:09.526
Why don't we find a time

00:15:09.526 --> 00:15:10.365
when you're free

00:15:10.406 --> 00:15:11.166
to get together

00:15:11.326 --> 00:15:12.645
and clear the air.

00:15:12.725 --> 00:15:13.446
What do you think?

00:15:14.765 --> 00:15:15.245
Okay.

00:15:15.845 --> 00:15:16.485
Alright then?

00:15:16.806 --> 00:15:17.566
I'm coming in.

00:15:25.806 --> 00:15:26.365
You...

00:15:26.965 --> 00:15:27.605
Who are you looking for?

00:15:28.926 --> 00:15:30.326
Isn't this Xu Yan's home?

00:15:32.446 --> 00:15:33.566
It's my daughter's home.

00:15:33.806 --> 00:15:35.206
Are you her colleague?

00:15:35.526 --> 00:15:36.286
Daughter?

00:15:36.686 --> 00:15:38.125
You are...?

00:15:38.406 --> 00:15:40.005
We're Yan's parents.

00:15:40.125 --> 00:15:41.326
We've been working abroad.

00:15:41.725 --> 00:15:43.125
Yan's getting married.

00:15:43.326 --> 00:15:43.965
So we came back specifically

00:15:43.966 --> 00:15:45.206
for the wedding.

00:15:45.645 --> 00:15:46.645
She's just downstairs buying something.

00:15:46.725 --> 00:15:47.645
She'll be right up.

00:15:49.725 --> 00:15:51.326
You're her parents?

00:15:51.566 --> 00:15:52.605
And you live abroad?

00:15:53.125 --> 00:15:54.525
Yes. We...

00:15:54.526 --> 00:15:56.125
We work at a university abroad.

00:15:57.365 --> 00:15:57.806
Yan,

00:15:57.965 --> 00:15:58.686
perfect timing.

00:15:59.206 --> 00:16:00.046
Your colleague is here to see you.

00:16:08.686 --> 00:16:09.965
Now I see.

00:16:10.206 --> 00:16:11.845
You've been lying all along.

00:16:12.245 --> 00:16:13.566
You hired people to pretend
to be your parents.

00:16:13.645 --> 00:16:15.644
And you've been telling everyone

00:16:15.645 --> 00:16:17.566
your parents live abroad.

00:16:18.046 --> 00:16:18.765
Yan.

00:16:24.645 --> 00:16:25.965
I know what I'm doing.

00:16:26.125 --> 00:16:27.166
I don't need you to remind me.

00:16:27.845 --> 00:16:29.806
You have some nerve.

00:16:29.965 --> 00:16:30.845
What if the Shen family

00:16:30.885 --> 00:16:31.365
finds out?

00:16:31.446 --> 00:16:32.166
How are you gonna handle that?

00:16:32.326 --> 00:16:32.845
No one

00:16:32.846 --> 00:16:34.005
will know if you don't tell them.

00:16:34.406 --> 00:16:36.125
You're gonna keep this lie going?

00:16:36.725 --> 00:16:37.885
You're smart.

00:16:37.926 --> 00:16:38.365
Why would you

00:16:38.446 --> 00:16:39.885
do something so stupid?

00:16:42.166 --> 00:16:43.326
What are you gonna do

00:16:43.406 --> 00:16:44.446
if you marry

00:16:44.765 --> 00:16:45.526
Shen Haoming?

00:16:45.845 --> 00:16:47.166
Keep lying to him? Your whole life?

00:16:49.605 --> 00:16:51.005
I'll cross that bridge
when I come to it.

00:16:51.485 --> 00:16:52.365
I only focus on the present.

00:16:56.406 --> 00:16:57.446
Haoming's mom

00:16:57.686 --> 00:16:58.965
looks down on my background.

00:16:59.806 --> 00:17:01.205
So how else am I supposed to marry him?

00:17:07.885 --> 00:17:08.445
I've seen the girls

00:17:08.446 --> 00:17:10.286
Haoming's mom sets him up with.

00:17:11.326 --> 00:17:12.526
They're all exceptional.

00:17:13.925 --> 00:17:14.726
I know you must

00:17:14.727 --> 00:17:15.766
look down on me for this.

00:17:15.966 --> 00:17:17.405
And I admit I'm in the wrong.

00:17:18.605 --> 00:17:19.486
But you're not me.

00:17:20.165 --> 00:17:21.645
You don't know what I've been through.

00:17:22.125 --> 00:17:23.445
And you can't understand my choices.

00:17:24.925 --> 00:17:26.165
All I can say is,

00:17:26.685 --> 00:17:28.365
before I met Shen Haoming,

00:17:28.766 --> 00:17:30.246
my life was colorless.

00:17:31.046 --> 00:17:31.845
He's the only one

00:17:31.846 --> 00:17:33.125
who's ever been willing to
take responsibility for me.

00:17:33.685 --> 00:17:34.685
The only one.

00:17:42.845 --> 00:17:43.445
I don't care

00:17:43.445 --> 00:17:44.326
what your reasons are.

00:17:44.445 --> 00:17:45.726
Lying is wrong.

00:17:49.326 --> 00:17:51.286
But if I don't lie,

00:17:52.766 --> 00:17:53.566
they'll force me

00:17:53.567 --> 00:17:54.806
to break up with Haoming.

00:17:56.006 --> 00:17:57.966
Everything I've worked so hard for

00:17:59.566 --> 00:18:00.526
in Jingzhou

00:18:01.286 --> 00:18:03.006
will be gone.

00:18:03.405 --> 00:18:04.286
Haven't I worked hard?

00:18:05.365 --> 00:18:06.205
I have.

00:18:06.246 --> 00:18:07.165
But did it get me anywhere?

00:18:11.645 --> 00:18:12.844
That's why I refuse

00:18:12.845 --> 00:18:14.246
to be that person anymore.

00:18:15.685 --> 00:18:17.365
The one who can be easily cast aside

00:18:18.885 --> 00:18:20.046
and looked down on.

00:18:27.046 --> 00:18:27.806
Life only has

00:18:27.885 --> 00:18:28.806
a few critical turning points.

00:18:29.405 --> 00:18:30.605
If you seize them,

00:18:31.046 --> 00:18:31.766
everything after

00:18:31.806 --> 00:18:33.006
becomes smooth sailing.

00:18:33.726 --> 00:18:35.125
But if you miss them,

00:18:35.365 --> 00:18:36.326
it's incredibly hard

00:18:36.326 --> 00:18:37.326
to turn things around.

00:18:44.605 --> 00:18:45.726
It's either I have nothing,

00:18:45.806 --> 00:18:46.445
or

00:18:47.605 --> 00:18:48.486
I have everything.

00:18:52.966 --> 00:18:53.726
Do you love him?

00:18:54.925 --> 00:18:56.806
Or are you just

00:18:56.845 --> 00:18:57.645
a complete fraud,

00:18:57.766 --> 00:18:58.566
only in it for his money?

00:19:01.445 --> 00:19:03.125
I want both a career and love.

00:19:05.086 --> 00:19:06.165
Who says

00:19:06.885 --> 00:19:07.766
you have to be penniless

00:19:07.767 --> 00:19:08.845
to prove your love is real?

00:19:12.925 --> 00:19:13.566
If you really feel

00:19:13.567 --> 00:19:14.726
you have to expose me...

00:19:27.726 --> 00:19:28.885
I don't know how to get through to you.

00:19:30.046 --> 00:19:30.566
But I also don't want to

00:19:30.605 --> 00:19:31.445
watch you go further

00:19:31.445 --> 00:19:32.286
down this wrong path.

00:19:32.966 --> 00:19:33.925
I won't come to see you again.

00:20:09.125 --> 00:20:10.246
I don't know how to get through to you.

00:20:11.405 --> 00:20:11.966
But I also don't want to

00:20:11.966 --> 00:20:12.806
watch you go further

00:20:12.845 --> 00:20:13.726
down this wrong path.

00:20:37.326 --> 00:20:38.246
Hey, what's up?

00:20:39.125 --> 00:20:39.605
Yan,

00:20:40.445 --> 00:20:41.726
my guest list

00:20:41.885 --> 00:20:42.526
is pretty much set.

00:20:42.845 --> 00:20:43.726
But I checked

00:20:43.766 --> 00:20:44.806
yours.

00:20:45.605 --> 00:20:47.086
Your dad, mom,

00:20:47.405 --> 00:20:48.605
Huanhuan, and Mr. Zhou.

00:20:48.806 --> 00:20:49.405
That's only four people.

00:20:49.486 --> 00:20:50.326
Isn't that a bit too few?

00:20:52.365 --> 00:20:54.286
My parents are usually abroad,

00:20:54.885 --> 00:20:56.125
and we don't see the relatives much.

00:20:57.726 --> 00:20:58.726
If I suddenly contact them

00:20:58.766 --> 00:21:00.125
just for the wedding,

00:21:01.165 --> 00:21:02.086
it'll seem like

00:21:02.125 --> 00:21:03.445
I'm just after the gift money.

00:21:03.726 --> 00:21:04.246
Right?

00:21:05.246 --> 00:21:05.766
I get it.

00:21:07.486 --> 00:21:09.405
So when are you bringing Grandma over?

00:21:10.766 --> 00:21:11.966
Bring her soon.

00:21:12.286 --> 00:21:12.885
Let her

00:21:12.966 --> 00:21:13.966
have a good time in Jingzhou.

00:21:17.645 --> 00:21:19.405
I'll go back and see what she thinks.

00:21:20.925 --> 00:21:23.046
You know how old she is.

00:21:25.006 --> 00:21:25.806
I'll go with you.

00:21:27.645 --> 00:21:29.445
You're so busy with the company.

00:21:29.885 --> 00:21:30.286
Next time.

00:21:30.605 --> 00:21:31.885
We'll go together next time, alright?

00:21:33.526 --> 00:21:35.125
I just really like to meet Grandma.

00:21:35.845 --> 00:21:37.684
But I already promised Grandma

00:21:37.685 --> 00:21:39.205
I'd spend a few days with her this time.

00:21:39.685 --> 00:21:41.165
If you came,

00:21:41.286 --> 00:21:42.806
it'll mess up our plans.

00:21:42.966 --> 00:21:43.526
Right?

00:21:44.685 --> 00:21:45.246
I see.

00:21:46.006 --> 00:21:47.165
You handle it then.

00:21:47.486 --> 00:21:47.885
Bye.

00:21:49.365 --> 00:21:49.925
Bye.

00:22:33.086 --> 00:22:33.645
What is it?

00:22:34.125 --> 00:22:34.726
Yan,

00:22:35.326 --> 00:22:35.925
your dad and I

00:22:35.966 --> 00:22:37.165
have been thinking it over
for several nights.

00:22:37.566 --> 00:22:38.326
We still want to

00:22:38.806 --> 00:22:40.046
attend your wedding.

00:22:40.486 --> 00:22:42.046
It's what your dad wants too.

00:22:42.806 --> 00:22:43.885
No matter what,

00:22:44.205 --> 00:22:45.806
you're our daughter.

00:22:47.326 --> 00:22:47.766
I know.

00:22:48.125 --> 00:22:48.645
I'm hanging up.

00:24:02.006 --> 00:24:02.566
Yan.

00:24:06.566 --> 00:24:07.165
Mr. Gao.

00:24:07.966 --> 00:24:09.046
Grandma said

00:24:09.205 --> 00:24:10.966
you went to the city to be a tailor.

00:24:11.486 --> 00:24:12.645
What brings you back to the village?

00:24:13.165 --> 00:24:14.566
That was years ago.

00:24:14.806 --> 00:24:15.326
The village

00:24:15.486 --> 00:24:16.526
is better than the city now.

00:24:16.966 --> 00:24:17.726
I came back,

00:24:17.845 --> 00:24:18.885
started a small orchard,

00:24:19.326 --> 00:24:20.286
set up a farm-stay business,

00:24:20.566 --> 00:24:21.726
even leased a little fishpond.

00:24:21.966 --> 00:24:23.404
I just host

00:24:23.405 --> 00:24:24.365
picking groups

00:24:24.925 --> 00:24:25.845
and fishing enthusiasts.

00:24:26.205 --> 00:24:27.925
City folks' money is easy to make.

00:24:28.526 --> 00:24:29.845
That's great.

00:24:31.246 --> 00:24:31.645
Yan,

00:24:32.006 --> 00:24:33.365
are you still working as a cook

00:24:33.405 --> 00:24:34.246
in the city?

00:24:35.086 --> 00:24:35.486
I...

00:24:36.445 --> 00:24:38.326
I'm not a cook.

00:24:38.726 --> 00:24:40.365
I host a food show.

00:24:41.526 --> 00:24:42.605
A food show?

00:24:42.766 --> 00:24:43.806
Like on TV?

00:24:43.966 --> 00:24:44.405
Yes.

00:24:45.326 --> 00:24:46.046
Like on TV.

00:24:46.047 --> 00:24:48.125
So you really eat all that food
on the show?

00:24:48.246 --> 00:24:49.364
If I need any fruit for it,

00:24:49.365 --> 00:24:50.605
I'll contact you.

00:24:50.885 --> 00:24:52.246
Yan, you get me.

00:24:54.806 --> 00:24:55.685
Thank you, Mr. Gao.

00:24:55.685 --> 00:24:56.405
No problem.

00:25:31.405 --> 00:25:31.885
Grandma.

00:25:32.566 --> 00:25:33.365
You're back.

00:25:33.566 --> 00:25:35.486
Why didn't you call me?

00:25:35.925 --> 00:25:36.685
Come on.

00:25:36.845 --> 00:25:37.645
Be careful. Okay, okay.

00:25:37.766 --> 00:25:38.365
It's fine.

00:25:38.526 --> 00:25:39.246
Alright. It's alright.

00:25:40.445 --> 00:25:40.885
Here.

00:25:41.165 --> 00:25:42.806
Why are you taking such a risk?

00:25:43.645 --> 00:25:45.645
This little chore isn't dangerous.

00:25:46.286 --> 00:25:47.445
Alright.

00:25:48.966 --> 00:25:49.526
I'll do it.

00:25:49.526 --> 00:25:50.165
You sit down over there.

00:25:50.526 --> 00:25:51.685
We've had

00:25:51.726 --> 00:25:53.246
a lot of rain this year,
and it's been cold.

00:25:53.685 --> 00:25:54.246
I'm afraid

00:25:54.365 --> 00:25:55.046
if I don't pick

00:25:55.047 --> 00:25:56.526
all these osmanthus flowers soon,

00:25:57.125 --> 00:25:58.246
they'll be past their bloom.

00:25:58.326 --> 00:25:59.726
Then I wouldn't be able to make

00:25:59.766 --> 00:26:01.125
that sweet osmanthus syrup.

00:26:01.605 --> 00:26:03.046
I'll pick them. Don't worry.

00:26:03.205 --> 00:26:04.046
You just sit tight.

00:26:04.806 --> 00:26:06.205
But I've told you,

00:26:06.845 --> 00:26:07.966
when no one's home,

00:26:08.046 --> 00:26:09.164
you shouldn't stand up so high.

00:26:09.165 --> 00:26:10.125
It's dangerous.

00:26:10.365 --> 00:26:11.966
I'm on a small stool.

00:26:12.645 --> 00:26:13.925
That's even more dangerous.

00:26:17.766 --> 00:26:19.086
